  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Doubtful points are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>I</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>n</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Hence continuous.</p>",
